**Vulnerability Type:** Read-after-write conflicts (phantom reads)

**Severity:** Medium

**Affected Code Location:** `Transfer` and `TransferFrom` functions (lines 180 and 190)

**Description:** The `Transfer` and `TransferFrom` functions do not handle concurrent transactions properly. If two transactions are executed simultaneously, one transaction may read the state before the other transaction has written to it, leading to phantom reads.

